        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this wonderful five-bedroom, six-bathroom heavily extended semi-detached home to the market, ideally located on a peaceful cul de sac in the ever-sought-after Old Bawn Drive, Old Bawn, Dublin 24. \r\n\r\nSituated in the popular Old Bawn area, this property enjoys an enviable location. Old Bawn Shopping Centre, and The Square Shopping Centre, are just a short drive away, offering a vibrant mix of retail, dining, and entertainment options. Families will appreciate the proximity to several well-regarded schools, while nature lovers will delight in the nearby Dodder Valley Park, perfect for leisurely walks or outdoor activities. \r\n\r\nCommuting is effortless with excellent transport links. Dublin Bus routes, including the 49, 65b S8 and S6, provide convenient and reliable access to the city centre and surrounding areas. The M50 motorway, just minutes away, offers quick connections to Dublin Airport, the greater Dublin area, and beyond. Whether you're traveling for work, school, or leisure, this location ensures that everything you need is within easy reach.\r\n\r\nBright, airy and most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 219 sqm spread over three floors compromises of entrance hallway with guest bathroom, large living room with fireplace, extra spacious dining/second living area, fully fitted kitchen, separate utility room and two double bedrooms with ensuite bathrooms. On large open plan dining/family area, separate utility room and guest bathroom. On the first floor you have four spacious bedrooms (three master ensuites) and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. The attic has been converted here which can be used for so many different purposes.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the property you have a private & enclosed garden with a highly sought after west facing orientation making it perfect for relaxing on them long sunny summer evenings with the use of a block built shed for storage. The front provides ample off-street parking on a maintenance free driveway on a peaceful cul de sac with almost no passing traffic. Number 15 Old Bawn Drive comes to the market in need of some modernisation throughout but due to its size & location has the potential to be the perfect family home, it has plenty of additional features such as double story extension to sider, attic conversion, gas heating with combi-boiler, spacious bedrooms and ample parking to name but a few. \r\n\r\nContact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing and see all that this home has to offer! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\nBER C2 \r\nC. 219 sqm \r\n6 Bed / 6 Bath\r\nHeavily extended \r\nDouble story extension to side \r\nAttic conversion \r\nCan be used for so many different purposes\r\nSemi-detached family home \r\nGood condition throughout\r\nJust some cosmetic modernisation needed \r\nExtremely spacious home \r\nEntrance hallway with ample storage\r\nLarge living room with fireplace \r\nFully fitted kitchen \r\nLarge open plan dining/family area \r\nSeparate utility room\r\nSix double bedrooms\r\nFive ensuite bathrooms \r\nMain family bathroom fully tiled \r\nGuest bathroom downstairs \r\nGas fired central heating\r\nCombi-boiler \r\nNew radiators \r\nDouble glazed windows \r\nPrivate rear garden \r\nSunny west facing orientation \r\nPerfect for relaxation \r\nShed for storage \r\nPlenty of parking to the front \r\nMaintenance free driveway \r\nLocated on peaceful cul de sac \r\nPlenty of bus routes on your doorstep \r\nWithin arm's reach of M50 and N7 Motorway \r\nHighly sought-after area \r\nPrime for people trading up \r\n\r\nDirections: D24 HW58"
      },
      {
